# Normalise to LF in the repository and on checkout, on every platform.
# The fixtures and expected-output tests compare exact bytes, and the Windows
# CI job must see the same line endings as macOS and Linux. Runtime handling of
# CRLF in a user's own Gradle files is separate and lives in FileEdit.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.zip binary
